1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:08,880
[SPEAKER_01] Dialog slavi svoj prvi rođen, i zato smo odlučili pitati naše male slušatelje što oni uopće znaju o logopediji, zašto idu kod logopeda i što tamo rade.

2
00:00:09,039 --> 00:00:10,560
[SPEAKER_01] Pa poslušajte što su nam rekli.

3
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:11,679
[SPEAKER_02] Spremna?

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,039
[SPEAKER_02] Jesi.

5
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:14,640
[SPEAKER_01] Tri, četiri.

6
00:00:15,519 --> 00:00:15,919
[SPEAKER_02] Sansa.

7
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,320
[SPEAKER_01] Jel ti znaš ko sam ja?

8
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:19,600
[SPEAKER_07] Laura.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,559
[SPEAKER_01] Laura, da.

10
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,760
[SPEAKER_01] Ja sam tvoj logo.

11
00:00:25,039 --> 00:00:25,519
[SPEAKER_02] Logo pet.

12
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,760
[SPEAKER_02] Jesi se udobno smjestio?

13
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,000
[SPEAKER_02] Da.

14
00:00:28,719 --> 00:00:29,120
[SPEAKER_02] Kako si?

15
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:29,920
[SPEAKER_02] Dobro.

16
00:00:30,399 --> 00:00:31,199
[SPEAKER_02] Gdje si danas bio?

17
00:00:32,719 --> 00:00:33,359
[SPEAKER_08] U skoli.

18
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:37,520
[SPEAKER_08] Pa bio sam u skoli i sad sam kod tebe.

19
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:38,479
[SPEAKER_02] Odlično.

20
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,479
[SPEAKER_02] Mogu te pitati nešto?

21
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:42,240
[SPEAKER_08] A kaj god?

22
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,000
[SPEAKER_02] Kaj god hoću?

23
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:44,320
[SPEAKER_02] Da.

24
00:00:44,799 --> 00:00:46,719
[SPEAKER_02] Recite meni, tko je logoped?

25
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,840
[SPEAKER_08] Oni koji uče djecu razgovarati.

26
00:00:52,640 --> 00:01:01,280
[SPEAKER_07] Logoped je jedna teta koja pomaže djeci da dobro izgovaraju.

27
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,560
[SPEAKER_07] Logoped je jedna teta koja nam pomaže čitati, progovoriti slova i progovoriti pisanje.

28
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:15,599
[SPEAKER_01] Pa logoped je osoba koja radi s djecom.

29
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:21,040
[SPEAKER_01] I, evo, pomaže djeci da bolje razmišljaju.

30
00:01:21,599 --> 00:01:28,480
[SPEAKER_00] To tijekom te uči, pa neka sladaj to je šepe, e, a, sve.

31
00:01:28,879 --> 00:01:29,760
[SPEAKER_03] Tko je logoped?

32
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,200
[SPEAKER_00] Teta toja.

33
00:01:31,599 --> 00:01:33,280
[SPEAKER_03] Ajde, ti meni reci, što ti misliš?

34
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:34,239
[SPEAKER_03] Tko je logoped?

35
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:35,200
[SPEAKER_03] Ti.

36
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:37,439
[SPEAKER_03] Ja, dobro, a što ja radim?

37
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:38,560
[SPEAKER_07] Kutic.

38
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:39,840
[SPEAKER_03] Što učim?

39
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:43,519
[SPEAKER_03] Mhm, a koga ja učim slova?

40
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,040
[SPEAKER_07] Ljubav.

41
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,640
[SPEAKER_04] Tko bi bio logoped?

42
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:47,760
[SPEAKER_07] Ti.

43
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:50,560
[SPEAKER_04] Ja, dobro, a što radim, logoped?

44
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,640
[SPEAKER_04] Što radi logoped?

45
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:59,519
[SPEAKER_00] Učava djecu slova.

46
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:01,040
[SPEAKER_02] Samo slova?

47
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:01,680
[SPEAKER_07] Da.

48
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,840
[SPEAKER_02] Mhm, i što ja radim?

49
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,200
[SPEAKER_02] Pomažeš mi.

50
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,200
[SPEAKER_02] Kako ja tebi pomažem?

51
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,400
[SPEAKER_02] Čitati.

52
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,479
[SPEAKER_02] Mhm, pomažem ti čitati.

53
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,919
[SPEAKER_02] Šta još radimo skupa?

54
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,479
[SPEAKER_02] Pisati.

55
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,360
[SPEAKER_02] Pisati.

56
00:02:14,479 --> 00:02:15,680
[SPEAKER_02] Pisati matematiku.

57
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:17,120
[SPEAKER_02] A i matematiku.

58
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:19,759
[SPEAKER_02] Znači, učimo pisati, čitati.

59
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,400
[SPEAKER_02] Šta još?

60
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,680
[SPEAKER_07] Učiti djecu kako da kako da mogu slova.

61
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,280
[SPEAKER_04] Mhm, a šta bi se čuli?

62
00:02:25,439 --> 00:02:26,240
[SPEAKER_04] Radimo još nešto.

63
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:28,719
[SPEAKER_07] Da?

64
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,319
[SPEAKER_06] Cetinu.

65
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,719
[SPEAKER_05] Šta si ti naučio kod logopeda?

66
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:43,840
[SPEAKER_06] Naučio sam kod logopeda kako adekvate smiriti.

67
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:47,039
[SPEAKER_05] Kako ti logoped još može pomoći?

68
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:52,639
[SPEAKER_05] Može nekom drugom pomoći za neke druge stvari, možda netko ko nema adekvate?

69
00:02:54,560 --> 00:03:07,919
[SPEAKER_06] Onome što se loše ponaša, ko ima teško u školi, a kad si rekao nekome kome ide loše u školi, šta njemu to ne ide, pa da mu logoped može pomoći?

70
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:10,639
[SPEAKER_06] Čitanje, pisanje, uredno.

71
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,719
[SPEAKER_06] što sam ja došao, zapravo.

72
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,639
[SPEAKER_05] Aha, zato si ti došao.

73
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,879
[SPEAKER_05] Je li još nešto može raditi, logoped?

74
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:17,599
[SPEAKER_06] Ne.

75
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:21,120
[SPEAKER_05] Okej, a kako tebi, logoped, pomaže?

76
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,919
[SPEAKER_07] Da me uči.

77
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:26,240
[SPEAKER_05] Da, a što te je logoped naučio?

78
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,000
[SPEAKER_05] Šta smo sve učile?

79
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,319
[SPEAKER_07] Sve smo učile.

80
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,240
[SPEAKER_07] Lutku.

81
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:35,520
[SPEAKER_02] Lutku.

82
00:03:36,879 --> 00:03:38,719
[SPEAKER_07] Nisam joj sad još čekala.

83
00:03:39,039 --> 00:03:40,319
[SPEAKER_02] Što smo još radili, vidi?

84
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,000
[SPEAKER_07] Po kaj se i voće.

85
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:44,400
[SPEAKER_02] Voće i povrće.

86
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,599
[SPEAKER_02] I povrće.

87
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:48,719
[SPEAKER_02] Je li tebi, logoped, pomaže nešto?

88
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:52,319
[SPEAKER_02] Je.

89
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,520
[SPEAKER_02] Reći R ili reći L?

90
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,159
[SPEAKER_07] Ne.

91
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,000
[SPEAKER_02] L, tako je.

92
00:04:00,479 --> 00:04:01,919
[SPEAKER_07] Pa pomaže mi ovako.

93
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:11,039
[SPEAKER_07] Kazuje neko soo, ja kažem Z, na primjer, Z, ja kažem, je bila još Z.

94
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,759
[SPEAKER_05] A kako te je bilo, opet, pomaže?

95
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:18,720
[SPEAKER_01] Pa meni pomaže kad nešto ne znam, pa onda dođem, naučim.

96
00:04:19,439 --> 00:04:21,279
[SPEAKER_01] I onda znam puno bolje u školi.

97
00:04:22,399 --> 00:04:25,040
[SPEAKER_01] I tako, volim dolaziti.

98
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,560
[SPEAKER_01] Pa puno bolje citam.

99
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:26,720
[SPEAKER_01] Znači, čitam.

100
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,000
[SPEAKER_01] I puno bolje opisujem riječi.

101
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,120
[SPEAKER_02] Ajde, bravo, super.

102
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:33,040
[SPEAKER_02] Je li tebi logoped pomaže?

103
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:33,920
[SPEAKER_08] Pa da.

104
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,000
[SPEAKER_02] Kako ti pomaže, logoped?

105
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:42,639
[SPEAKER_08] Kad je ružno, pa da uči boje pečata.

106
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:46,000
[SPEAKER_02] I šta mi sve učimo, samo pričati ili još neke stvari?

107
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:47,680
[SPEAKER_08] Čitati.

108
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:48,800
[UNKNOWN] Mhm.

109
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,560
[SPEAKER_02] Svašta radimo, je li to?

110
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:58,560
[SPEAKER_08] Svašta to je tvoja baca.

111
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,600
[SPEAKER_02] Svašta to je tvoja mašta, daj penu.

112
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,839
[SPEAKER_04] A što si ti naučio kod logopeda?

113
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,279
[SPEAKER_04] Svašta.

114
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,000
[SPEAKER_04] Svašta.

115
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:06,720
[SPEAKER_04] Šta je to?

116
00:05:08,639 --> 00:05:10,399
[SPEAKER_07] Učio sam slovo le.

117
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:15,519
[SPEAKER_07] Učio sam kako se koristi ta vuleta.

118
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,040
[SPEAKER_04] Dobro.

119
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,040
[SPEAKER_07] A šta sad učiš?

120
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:20,319
[SPEAKER_07] Slovo le.

121
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:23,279
[SPEAKER_07] Naučio sam pa rječica.

122
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:26,639
[SPEAKER_02] Daj mi, recite, što ti najviše voliš raditi kod logopeda?

123
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,240
[SPEAKER_08] Jako od zadaća.

124
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:29,519
[SPEAKER_02] Stvarno.

125
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:29,839
[SPEAKER_08] Da.

126
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,920
[SPEAKER_02] Najviše voliš rječica.

127
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,519
[SPEAKER_02] Ne voliš kad igramo igre?

128
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,759
[SPEAKER_08] Voliš kad igramo igre.

129
00:05:36,319 --> 00:05:38,000
[SPEAKER_02] Šta ti draži igri ili zadaća?

130
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:38,800
[SPEAKER_08] Igre.

131
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,920
[SPEAKER_02] Na eto, vidiš da ima nešto bolje, je li tako?

132
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:45,360
[SPEAKER_08] Da, kad smo vidjeli, ja sam se zabavio.

133
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:51,040
[SPEAKER_07] Onda je slika pa ima pitanja.

134
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:54,399
[SPEAKER_07] Pa onda gledamo sliku i onda zvučemo.

135
00:05:55,519 --> 00:05:56,399
[SPEAKER_03] To ti dobro ide.

136
00:05:57,759 --> 00:06:01,600
[SPEAKER_07] Znači, malo je slika po kričice.

137
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,040
[SPEAKER_05] A, to ti se sviđa?

138
00:06:03,519 --> 00:06:03,600
[SPEAKER_07] Da.

139
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:04,240
[SPEAKER_05] Super.

140
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:08,720
[SPEAKER_05] A što je najbolja stvar koja ti se dogodila kod logopeda?

141
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,079
[SPEAKER_07] Da si trolla.

142
00:06:12,639 --> 00:06:14,000
[SPEAKER_05] A, to ti je bila najbolja stvar.

143
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,680
[SPEAKER_05] To te je najviše razveselilo.

144
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:15,839
[SPEAKER_05] Da.

145
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,319
[SPEAKER_05] Pa to mi je baš lijepo zaučut, baš mi je drago.

146
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:19,519
[SPEAKER_05] Najbolja stvar.

147
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:20,959
[SPEAKER_05] Da si trolla.

148
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:21,439
[SPEAKER_05] A ako snimaš neko svećenje?

149
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,040
[SPEAKER_01] Možda kad si bio mlađi, možda.

150
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:31,839
[SPEAKER_01] Pa, bilo mi je super kad sam došao, ja sam se igrao s nečim, avutičima i takvim stvarima.

151
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,600
[SPEAKER_07] Marko Gusarko.

152
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,360
[SPEAKER_04] Zašto Marko Gusarko?

153
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:42,079
[SPEAKER_07] Pa, zato što ima maslova i onda on isplodilo i da izvuče glavu.

154
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:45,600
[SPEAKER_04] Aha, znači, ova igra, Marko Gusarko, ti je najbolja.

155
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:50,560
[SPEAKER_07] Da izvuče glavu, to zvuči u more i pojednika morski psi.

156
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:56,160
[SPEAKER_04] Kad bojaš, to voliš raditi.

157
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:57,920
[SPEAKER_04] Da, u onoj.

158
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:06,720
[SPEAKER_00] Sobim tim proma, onda sa slovima povrato, i onda tamo sam i našao šah.

159
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:14,240
[SPEAKER_00] Tu je još bila teta Lucija, i onda mi se to dogodilo, našao šah.

160
00:07:14,959 --> 00:07:17,439
[SPEAKER_00] I onda sam igrao šah.

161
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:22,560
[SPEAKER_02] Recci mi, je li ima neka super stvar koja ti se nekad dogodila kod logopeda?

162
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:25,040
[SPEAKER_02] Ne, nikada ništa.

163
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:25,759
[SPEAKER_07] Nikad.

164
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,000
[SPEAKER_02] Ništa ti se lijepo nije dogodilo.

165
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:28,639
[SPEAKER_02] A te?

166
00:07:29,199 --> 00:07:32,480
[SPEAKER_02] Pa meni se svaki put lijepo nešto dogodi kad mi ti dođeš.

167
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:33,680
[SPEAKER_02] Kaj?

168
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,879
[SPEAKER_02] Pa ja volim kad mi ti dođeš, onda budem jako sretna.

169
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:38,399
[SPEAKER_02] A ti?

170
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:39,759
[SPEAKER_02] Ja isto.

171
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:43,040
[SPEAKER_02] Jesam li tebi nekad nešto lijepo dogodilo kod logopeda?

172
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:43,759
[SPEAKER_08] Pa.

173
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,000
[SPEAKER_02] Ili nešto smiješno?

174
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:48,319
[SPEAKER_08] Nije.

175
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,519
[SPEAKER_02] Nije baš.

176
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:51,040
[SPEAKER_08] Pa nije.

177
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:54,079
[SPEAKER_02] Jesmo se nekad zezali, ti i ja?

178
00:07:55,600 --> 00:08:05,600
[SPEAKER_07] Najbolje mi je kada imam vrijeme za odmor, onda mogu i rješavati labyrinte.

179
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:08,160
[SPEAKER_02] Labyrinte ili kad odemo na WC?

180
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:09,680
[UNKNOWN] Da.

181
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,920
[SPEAKER_02] I popit malo vode.

182
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:14,720
[SPEAKER_02] Znači, kod logopeda ti je najbolji odmor.

183
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:15,279
[SPEAKER_07] Da.

184
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,480
[SPEAKER_02] Pa dobro, šta?

185
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:19,920
[SPEAKER_02] Ne mogu ja tebi reći što je tebi najbolje, je li tako?

186
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:20,639
[SPEAKER_01] Da.

187
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:22,959
[SPEAKER_01] I kako ti se sviđa ovdje kod logopeda?

188
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:23,839
[SPEAKER_01] Da.

189
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:25,519
[SPEAKER_01] I što si sve naučio?

190
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,120
[SPEAKER_07] Znam čitati.

191
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,480
[SPEAKER_01] Znaš čitati?

192
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:32,080
[SPEAKER_07] Iz čitanja sam dobio petice.

193
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:32,799
[SPEAKER_01] Bravo.

194
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,320
[SPEAKER_07] I ovo je više petice.

195
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,159
[SPEAKER_07] I možeš sad više odrezati.

196
00:08:36,399 --> 00:08:37,679
[SPEAKER_02] Bravo, to je odlično.

197
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,840
[SPEAKER_02] Jel ti voliš ići kod logopeda?

198
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:40,480
[SPEAKER_07] Da.

199
00:08:41,519 --> 00:08:42,399
[SPEAKER_02] Što ti je najbolje?

200
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,159
[SPEAKER_07] Peti i optice.

201
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:46,480
[SPEAKER_02] Prati i loptice, u čemu?

202
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:48,159
[SPEAKER_07] U periliću ljublja.

203
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,799
[SPEAKER_02] U periliću rublja, periliću loptice.

204
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:54,960
[SPEAKER_02] U čemu?

205
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:56,639
[SPEAKER_02] Peremo loptice.

206
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:57,279
[SPEAKER_02] Ajde.

207
00:08:57,679 --> 00:08:58,879
[SPEAKER_00] Iđu ljubija.

208
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,639
[SPEAKER_02] U perilici rublja.

209
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:02,480
[SPEAKER_02] Što još peremo u perilici rublja?

210
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,960
[SPEAKER_00] Maje i čaja.

211
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:05,919
[SPEAKER_01] Olično.

212
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:11,600
[SPEAKER_01] A što ti misliš, kakva osoba mora biti logoped da bi bio dobar logoped?

213
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,399
[SPEAKER_01] Što misliš, što on mora sve znati?

214
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:20,639
[SPEAKER_07] Logoped ide u školu preko 200 mjeseca.

215
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,879
[SPEAKER_01] Je preko 200 mjeseca da.

216
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:25,039
[SPEAKER_01] Logoped ide u školu pet godina.

217
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,960
[SPEAKER_01] Mislim da je to previše.

218
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:27,919
[SPEAKER_01] Da.

219
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:33,759
[SPEAKER_01] Misliš da bi logop logopedi trebali ići u školu?

220
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:34,879
[SPEAKER_07] Šest mjeseci.

221
00:09:35,279 --> 00:09:36,480
[SPEAKER_01] Šest mjeseci, i to je to.

222
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:39,919
[SPEAKER_05] Što ti misliš, kakva osoba treba biti logoped?

223
00:09:41,679 --> 00:09:42,320
[SPEAKER_07] Zaposlana.

224
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,320
[SPEAKER_05] Zaposlana, to je istina.

225
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:47,120
[SPEAKER_05] Kakva osoba treba biti logoped?

226
00:09:48,159 --> 00:09:50,399
[SPEAKER_06] Neko koja misli o djeci da su.

227
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,639
[SPEAKER_06] koja žele pomoć.

228
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:53,919
[SPEAKER_05] Mhm, super.

229
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,679
[SPEAKER_06] Ko to ne radi za novce.

230
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:58,559
[SPEAKER_02] Ok, možeš mi još nešto reći?

231
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:00,159
[SPEAKER_02] Ristojan.

232
00:10:00,639 --> 00:10:01,519
[SPEAKER_02] Dobro, dalje.

233
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:02,879
[SPEAKER_02] Ne psovat.

234
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,639
[SPEAKER_02] Ne psovat, što još?

235
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:08,639
[SPEAKER_02] Ne raditi gluposti, ne pametni.

236
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,519
[SPEAKER_02] Dobro, ti si snadna.

237
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,559
[SPEAKER_02] To je istina.

238
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,080
[SPEAKER_02] I što još?

239
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,360
[SPEAKER_02] Ili je to sve?

240
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:16,879
