241
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,879
[SPEAKER_07] E, zanimljiv.

242
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,320
[SPEAKER_07] Pametan.

243
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,120
[SPEAKER_02] Mhm.

244
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:24,480
[SPEAKER_07] Dobar, nježniji, ljubazniji.

245
00:10:24,799 --> 00:10:26,799
[SPEAKER_02] A, je smije ostaviti djecu samu?

246
00:10:27,759 --> 00:10:30,240
