247
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,399
[SPEAKER_02] I ne može kasniti, tako je.

248
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,879
[SPEAKER_07] Musi kreslo.

249
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:35,440
[SPEAKER_04] Dobro.

250
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:38,159
[SPEAKER_04] A kako oni trebaju biti ono dobri, zločesti?

251
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:39,440
[SPEAKER_07] Dobri.

252
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,039
[SPEAKER_04] Ok, kako još?

253
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,840
[SPEAKER_07] Trebao bi biti zločest.

254
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:46,399
[SPEAKER_04] Mamo je za sad.

255
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:52,799
[SPEAKER_07] Pa kad djete bude izvozesta, tečko je li cura?

256
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:53,840
[SPEAKER_04] Mhm.

257
00:10:54,159 --> 00:10:55,360
[SPEAKER_04] A kako oni trebaju biti?

258
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,320
[SPEAKER_07] Lijepo bučeni.

259
00:10:59,519 --> 00:11:00,399
[SPEAKER_04] Lijepo bučeni.

260
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:01,440
[SPEAKER_05] A još nešto?

261
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:04,159
[SPEAKER_06] Ne.

262
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:08,399
[SPEAKER_05] A kako izgleda logoped, kako bi ti opisao nekog logopeda?

263
00:11:08,799 --> 00:11:09,600
[SPEAKER_06] Koznanstvenik.

264
00:11:10,399 --> 00:11:11,120
[SPEAKER_05] Koznanstvenik?

265
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:11,440
[SPEAKER_06] Da.

266
00:11:13,279 --> 00:11:20,240
[SPEAKER_06] Kad bi druge teče gledalo, logoped da misle da je snagstvenik u ukusu.

267
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,399
[SPEAKER_06] Dobro, gledalo, logoped.

268
00:11:24,399 --> 00:11:27,200
[SPEAKER_06] Znači, ovako normalni radnik.

269
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:32,399
[SPEAKER_07] Ovo je malo teško pitanje.

270
00:11:32,799 --> 00:11:33,759
[SPEAKER_07] Teško pitanje.

271
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,519
[SPEAKER_04] Pa što sam iz škapa izgleda?

272
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,159
[SPEAKER_07] Nekom ne blaga jednog.

273
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,519
[SPEAKER_07] Dobro, okej.

274
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:44,960
[SPEAKER_07] Sad s rdećim košom.

275
00:11:45,919 --> 00:11:46,799
[SPEAKER_07] Tamo je šmođu.

276
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,840
[SPEAKER_07] Ima nešto tu.

277
00:11:50,639 --> 00:11:51,360
[SPEAKER_05] A rep ima.

278
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:55,519
[SPEAKER_07] Sa crvenom majicom.

279
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,679
[SPEAKER_03] Sa crvenom majicom, dobro.

280
00:11:58,159 --> 00:12:00,559
