281
00:12:01,039 --> 00:12:01,039
[UNKNOWN] Da.

282
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,759
[SPEAKER_02] A kako izgleda jedan logoped?

283
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:05,679
