284
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:06,240
[SPEAKER_02] Ne.

285
00:12:06,879 --> 00:12:08,000
[SPEAKER_02] Kako izgleda jedan logoped?

286
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,759
[SPEAKER_02] Bio si kod logopeda nekoliko.

287
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,159
[SPEAKER_02] Gdje logoped nosi.

288
00:12:13,919 --> 00:12:14,399
[SPEAKER_07] Uniformu.

289
00:12:14,879 --> 00:12:17,120
