290
00:12:17,679 --> 00:12:18,159
[SPEAKER_07] Uniformu.

291
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:18,799
[SPEAKER_02] Kakvu?

292
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:20,320
[SPEAKER_07] Bijelu.

293
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,879
