294
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:24,240
[SPEAKER_07] Ne.

295
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:25,039
[SPEAKER_02] Nego?

296
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:29,279
[SPEAKER_07] Nego neki možda, a neki možda ne.

297
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:35,919
[SPEAKER_07] Pa, ima obucu crnu, hoću u majicu.

298
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:37,679
