299
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,000
[SPEAKER_02] Ja nemam žutu majicu danas.

300
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,120
[SPEAKER_08] A dukse?

301
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,639
[SPEAKER_02] Nemam dukse.

302
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,200
[SPEAKER_08] Ajde, ali vidio.

303
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,120
[SPEAKER_02] Ti imaš dukse, ja nemam.

304
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:48,720
[SPEAKER_02] Što ja imam obučeno?

305
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,679
[SPEAKER_08] Logopetsku majicu.

306
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:54,320
[SPEAKER_02] Logopetsku majicu, to ti se zove kuta.

307
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,039
[SPEAKER_08] Kuta.

308
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,600
