310
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:03,120
[SPEAKER_06] Crnu, ali ovdje je onda bijela majica.

311
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,399
[SPEAKER_01] Aha, crni sa ko.

312
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:09,440
[SPEAKER_01] Aha, to je jako profesionalno.

313
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:11,600
