314
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:13,279
[SPEAKER_01] I kravatu mora imati lobo.

315
00:13:13,679 --> 00:13:16,000
[SPEAKER_01] Aha, znači to je jako nešto profesionalno.

316
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,600
[SPEAKER_01] Ali ja nemam sad kravatu.

317
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,320
[SPEAKER_06] Neveš.

318
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:18,480
[SPEAKER_06] Nemoveže.

319
00:13:18,639 --> 00:13:20,159
