323
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:31,440
[SPEAKER_01] Imamo i žep na udici, da.

324
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:33,759
[SPEAKER_02] Možeš još jedno pitanje?

325
00:13:34,799 --> 00:13:34,799
[UNKNOWN] Ne.

326
00:13:35,679 --> 00:13:36,799
