343
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,759
[SPEAKER_07] Ideš vječe sad?

344
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:20,559
[SPEAKER_07] Jeddeš ručak.

345
00:14:21,679 --> 00:14:22,799
[SPEAKER_03] Dobro, još nešto.

346
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:24,159
[SPEAKER_03] Samo jedem.

347
00:14:24,639 --> 00:14:25,360
[SPEAKER_03] Jedem i radim.

348
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:27,600
[SPEAKER_03] Ispava.

349
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:30,559
[SPEAKER_07] Pin je u mobitel.

350
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,399
[SPEAKER_04] Pin je u mobitel.

351
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,919
[SPEAKER_06] Dobro, i šta je još?

352
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:43,200
[SPEAKER_06] Kuplju stvari za kuću, peče ih, grija, preživi zimu i te stvari.

353
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:44,399
[SPEAKER_04] Ok, super.

354
00:14:46,559 --> 00:14:49,919
[SPEAKER_07] Jedno, ako su gladni, piju.

355
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:55,279
[SPEAKER_07] I ute se na djecu, ako nešto skaje.

356
00:14:56,240 --> 00:15:00,240
