357
00:15:00,639 --> 00:15:01,679
[SPEAKER_04] Peče pelocinke.

358
00:15:02,639 --> 00:15:03,600
[SPEAKER_04] Dobro, što još?

359
00:15:04,639 --> 00:15:05,360
[SPEAKER_01] Ili je to to?

360
00:15:06,559 --> 00:15:07,039
[SPEAKER_01] To je to.

361
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:07,679
[SPEAKER_01] Dobro.

362
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,000
